Log Source
+-------------------+----------------------------------------------+
| Name              | cluster-health                               |
| Display Name      | Cluster health events                        |
| Resource          | kafka                                        |
| ID Prefix         | lkc                                          |
| CRN Elements      | organization/environment/cloud-cluster/kafka |
| Max Lookback Days | 3                                            |
| Full-Text Search  | true                                         |
| Full-Text Fields  | message                                      |
+-------------------+----------------------------------------------+

Search Fields
     Name    |  Type  |         Allowed Values          
-------------+--------+---------------------------------
  id         | string |                                 
  event_type | enum   | SERVICE_MAINTENANCE,            
             |        | HEALTH_ALERT,                   
             |        | CONFLUENT_STATUS_UPDATED,       
             |        | SERVICE_ISSUE_DETECTED          
  level      | enum   | INFO, WARN, ERROR               

Returned Fields (each log record)
        Name       |   Type    | Default |          Description            
-------------------+-----------+---------+---------------------------------
  timestamp        | timestamp | true    | Event time, RFC 3339 UTC.       
  level            | enum      | true    | Severity level: INFO, WARN,     
                   |           |         | ERROR.                          
  message          | string    | true    | Human-readable description of   
                   |           |         | the event.                      
  event_type       | enum      | true    | Type of cluster health event.   
  id               | string    | false   | Unique identifier for this log  
                   |           |         | record.                         
  crn              | string    | false   | Confluent Resource Name of the  
                   |           |         | resource the event concerns.    
  source           | string    | false   | Component or subsystem that     
                   |           |         | generated the event.            
  event_id         | string    | false   | Event-specific identifier,      
                   |           |         | when provided.                  
  status           | string    | false   | Status associated with the      
                   |           |         | event, when applicable.         
  cloud_cluster_id | string    | false   | lkc- ID the event belongs to.   
